  "content": "\n\n# 說明\n為龍息賦予彩虹紋理\n\n# 版本支援\n支援 Java 版 1.16.2 - 26.2\n\n# 相容性\n與任何修改龍息紋理的內容不相容。其餘內容應可正常運作。\n\n# 替代資源包\n我的數據包 [Bottle of Rainbows](https://modrinth.com/datapack/bottle-of-rainbows) 添加了帶有該紋理的自訂藥水，若您希望使用帶有該紋理的自訂物品，可參考此數據包。\n\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Nerd_1023?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\"><img alt=\"patreon-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/m5AGYxRj3g\"><img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\"></a>",
